#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:21
#: 0e2d322b578b45bfb22b2cb36f02c9b7 1329b0804ede4553b7a1c16301805953
#: 85a963bc15f74c018492a570e079ac58 e96ca02705a54ad48eda7792aca89fd5
#: f7b5530a9132437f9363b3331a7926ec
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:26
#: 0e2aa01e86554795adc2f66d61d976ec 352e30b9f17e42e69cc5f515ec630b04
#: a73aaa6b744e408887faa9cde1fb82c7 b30c392c9337412da1c85ea69c464d3c
#: f98f9f8bb0a44c6ea64572787cedd802
msgid ""
"The Tarot gimbal's red and black power wires should be connected directly to"
" a 2S or 3S battery. If you plan to use 4S (or higher), please use a voltage"
" regulator to ensure the voltage stays within safe operating limits: DC 7.4 "
"V - 14.8 V (recommended 12 V). 3DR RTF Quad, Y6, and X8 include a voltage "
"regular to allow use of 4S batteries with the Tarot gimbal"
msgstr ""
"Tarot 云台的红色和黑色电源线应直接连接到 2S 或 3S 电池。如果计划使用 4S（或更高）电池，请使用稳压器确保电压在安全工作范围内：DC "
"7.4V - 14.8V（推荐 12V）。3DR RTF 四旋翼、Y6 和 X8 包含稳压器，允许使用 4S 电池与 Tarot 云台配合。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:27
#: 133efeabf78a4126816a647e2a248de6 427fb643a53e4f70ba1dd05a59de5bf0
#: 74f888b1649c4886980cea28dbd592d1 8b0051faa035451aae6f442b7eb366ef
#: b5b6635ae6804ad7b72910fa9891dd36
msgid "The \"T\" pin should be connected to the Pixhawk's AUX1 signal pin"
msgstr "「T」 引脚应连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX1 信号引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:28
#: 02257bceaa2c4967a95e6c97a094130d 0df6297c1ce947338c4f4a8bc2c51f5d
#: c175317acfdc4b5ba3af87ab050980b9 d6680a9dd67c4e5591de2f1b880362db
#: d7d6b740a44a440da9c482a3df33647a
msgid ""
"One of the two \"-\" pins should be connected to the Pixhawk's AUX1 ground "
"pin"
msgstr "两个 「-」 引脚中的一个应连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX1 地引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:31
#: 1b165093a7e84b4b9fd52059723e1e51 3ba52bf6e2ca4be6b2021f876b120848
#: 50fafd91347745e89eafd74eca52edbe b1f130f0693a49de92a7c85a07deb80f
#: f3243f6021b443139cea61196943d81f
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:33
#: 3da2dea1d3454d60afa437dc59a4668e 9286ddf12f6b47b982501c72c65c3bc9
#: 9550e1f13f794742be7c44ed7c9a975f d4a15020b873455c83c21ea9c5d89366
#: e34e4a2035574c96a1428d29c3425d40
msgid ""
"Paper instructions are normally provided with the gimbal but a slightly out "
"of date user manual can be found in the \"User Manual\" directory of the "
"`Tarot Gimbal Firmware v1.5 zip "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ file."
msgstr ""
"云台通常附带纸质说明书，但也可以在 `Tarot 云台固件 v1.5 压缩包 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ 的 「User Manual」 目录中找到略显过时的用户手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:36
#: 843cfbb5b23e425ea87f842918350c7a 893d13b9536645e092a11263a86e9ff9
#: cd3c913b25d44839932488fd71fe63c4 f73b9fbce66d4731b011eb2b089a52b6
#: ff3e550546c24bbda828f3daefed8e25
msgid ""
"Upon powering your vehicle, the gimbal will display a solid yellow light "
"while it is starting and calibrating. Do not touch the gimbal while it is "
"starting up. When the gimbal displays a blinking blue light, it is ready for"
" flight. If the gimbal is not connected to the autopilot, it will perform "
"basic stabilization without autopilot control, indicated by a solid blue "
"light."
msgstr ""
"飞行器上电后，云台在启动和校准时会显示常亮黄灯。云台启动期间请勿触碰。当云台显示蓝灯闪烁时，表示已准备好飞行。若云台未连接到飞控，它将执行基本稳定（不受飞控控制），以常亮蓝灯指示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:43
#: 11a722843b41435cb922141a886c2613 330acffac23642219c91d2dad6a7dce0
#: 35d77cab2ead4c64a7c3a43fc6ed928a 4394acf38f784b60a043fd716b0ce40f
#: 82b39054e5db422da5c9a148da2eb42e
msgid "**LED meanings**"
msgstr "**LED 含义**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:45
#: 311c7da1c1744789a82fedf5e043ed69 329cd63e46cb4c1c9717b4c502f78672
#: 5c0c4a826a734c27955fcce38ba0fd0a d5ccdf0023694815bd3943715bb687f4
#: f7228c7f237341a3b87331545058100a
msgid "Solid yellow      = calibrating"
msgstr "常亮黄灯 = 正在校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:46
#: 00595ca4a14a4b619c03279f3749f265 32b3cf995d5c4010802094ebaec438c4
#: def55b7e9d7345fcbc15d2db1abec709 fa5c3d125e6448368e23d2028ea4c0de
#: fae61d15c9294ee9b6773edbf36310f6
msgid "Blinking blue      = ready, connected to autopilot"
msgstr "蓝灯闪烁 = 就绪，已连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:47
#: 1b2e4166587441cf909948e44bef4201 31de58b5843843bea594cc5be52f0ee9
#: 6d9dd070a2ec452f882be18111e93ffd b74c61878adf4f3caca5784ad0d78020
#: d5a4fb85449b42a1a29871dfdf0b8bd2
msgid "Solid blue     = ready, not connected to autopilot"
msgstr "常亮蓝灯 = 就绪，未连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:50
#: 5d38feb492b34629a79391b4af08dbb2 63986f4c0666492fb6ca1375dfa41577
#: 776f94e662ae46b0a5614e2cf4e1dde7 7df22ed910b346a881d85f2a02093b1f
#: 7e0015058fed437c82ac0baf916df32e
msgid "Configuring the Gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:52
#: 06ecf3ace42a40aaaac160642b7433d4 827b6f9759aa4407b6376ddbb92d1bd1
#: 8668ba2d3f8f40bba4ec7c08a27e9954 c8ac9716252b430580ff6ce3424a7dd6
#: f2ac04c1f5334ee2b35608e5c0942446
msgid ""
"Tarot gimbals normally work out of the box but if you wish to change the "
"gimbal's internal configuration:"
msgstr "Tarot 云台通常开箱即用，但若需更改云台内部配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:55
#: 3c20b37742bc40a686246735b2d55efc 405202f0708e4e0ba44a95f6f0b498aa
#: 85c14ac5178347648ab02764cc2c4fe8 8939d55b21864e30a785185b70c729c0
#: beb0c7e4862f4c389f2af278bf3872fe
msgid ""
"Use the provided USB dongle to connect the Gimbal board to your computer "
"(Windows only).  If this is the first time you have plugged in the dongle "
"you will likely see a USB device installation window. After successful "
"installation of the driver a new COM port named \"Prolific USB-to-Serial "
"Comm Port\" should appear in the Device Manager as shown below.  If drivers "
"cannot be found you may be able to install Windows 7 or Windows XP drivers "
"using one of the .exe files found in the \"driver\" directory of the `Tarot "
"Gimbal Firmware v1.5 zip "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ file"
msgstr ""
"使用随附的 USB 适配器将云台板连接到电脑（仅限 Windows）。若首次插入适配器，可能会看到 USB "
"设备安装窗口。成功安装驱动后，设备管理器中应出现名为 「Prolific USB-to-Serial Comm Port」 的新 COM "
"端口，如下图所示。若找不到驱动，可尝试使用 `Tarot 云台固件 v1.5 压缩包 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ 中 「driver」 目录下的 .exe 文件安装 Windows 7 或 Windows XP 驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:71
#: 016b403126e5472fbac91e46edc1f9e1 0831a7d1fce84ad49eec64b08bee3c76
#: 2059a5439f234912a1c31f0745537b9c 945e6824d9ad44b9b8a825ad52bf7e91
#: e9f867748b654bec92ddba7bbbef3409
msgid ""
"Windows 8 and 10 users may find issues with the Prolific USB-to-Serial "
"driver not starting.  This issue can apparently be resolved according by "
"`following instructions on this web page: "
"<http://leftbraintinkering.blogspot.com/2013/05/usb-to-serial-"
"prolific-2303-device.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"Windows 8 和 10 用户可能遇到 Prolific USB-to-Serial 驱动无法启动的问题。可按照 `此网页的说明 "
"<http://leftbraintinkering.blogspot.com/2013/05/usb-to-serial-"
"prolific-2303-device.html>`__ 解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:73
#: 1b3a77d6eab4484b884c35cac7736b4d 38cbd93514484adc9a7e5d10031bb437
#: 69c828265e04438f9a003abb328dbfab 7873a17375274abf8a30a3d6861d2c2e
#: c6cb9f11022c4dfdb0b00b5474e08194
msgid ""
"Download and unzip the `Tarot Gimbal Firmware v1.5 zip "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ file to a convenient place on your computer"
msgstr ""
"下载并解压 `Tarot 云台固件 v1.5 压缩包 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ 到电脑便于访问的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:74
#: 2f619d7e6e6c4d8ebb8f6b3bb8b9e36f 6b4bad0937954b9e96f4342e0adf9f8d
#: 7e0172090873499382802a2c12215a52 85a08810213e434292c0ef7354bc8f7c
#: 955297c4957040cdafc3959a4dacd5d1
msgid ""
"Double click on the **ZYX-BMGC-EN_V1.5.exe** file (found in the above zip) "
"and the configuration UI shown below should appear"
msgstr "双击 **ZYX-BMGC-EN_V1.5.exe** 文件（位于上述压缩包中），配置界面如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:79
#: 14c951d5fff14bc38faacc843db50d03 4d1d0c4001014901a6e40bbd7fc8998f
#: 4d254a3bb3d44eefa4971655970a11c1 901016d23dbe4a93b12a3dd3b063c059
#: eafec245c485481eb75738c6884c2f9c
msgid "Power the Gimbal by plugging in the battery"
msgstr "连接电池为云台供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:80
#: 1c56bae7582a4474bb498249cff0e682 2866fef148c447c0a6f6d0a1d8037899
#: 62efc0fb712245fa9ac2c57a5950e6c0 6af4f1de701c432bb1d7dd37fd13981c
#: c557aa0d6f0d4ccdbfb1fb12623f31e4
msgid ""
"In the configuration UI, select the COM port and press the **Open COM Port**"
" button.  After a few seconds the image of the camera should begin moving as"
" the gimbal is moved"
msgstr "在配置界面中选择 COM 端口，然后点击 **Open COM Port** 按钮。几秒钟后，移动云台时相机图像应开始移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:81
#: 0d8da19b66574b0b9a6ac37922b6eaa1 15087e88b14c4d46990ee8e8b8665487
#: 45d90b422f6a4d5caab6eb2c7743a3c6 9a6d6ad204964b41895913732cd5a402
#: cfd1c7cbffd84a68808aa9e823028444
msgid ""
"The most important setting is to set the **Default Mode** (just above COM "
"port drop-down) to **Default Mode: stick position mode**.  Select this and "
"press **Write Settings To Flash**"
msgstr ""
"最重要的设置是将 **Default Mode** （COM 端口下拉菜单正上方）设置为 **Default Mode: stick position "
"mode** （摇杆位置模式）。选择此项并点击 **Write Settings To Flash** （写入设置到闪存）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:84
#: 394e865e3d9042e5b01b501571c6863c 4aeff69011504ba9905be3bd6dcca62c
#: 79e3df35b32d41b7a0a61fe01e59082e a09fb4b3c7da4e35926c3dfed2f1ee52
#: d2b83438b110497faa317bde98278802
msgid "Set-up through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:89
#: 7a45a0fe3fbf42389f4c8a14b38fb2d3 9c35b4f7a85d4dcbbf4ff0f600f16e94
#: ee859c6fdcff45708646829b2ccf3184 f26322599fd14f968298ffe746ec0631
#: f723e027230441c99cb07c5371ee3e58
msgid ""
"If using the Mission Planner a Camera Gimbal setup screen is available as "
"shown above:"
msgstr "若使用 Mission Planner，如上图所示有相机云台设置界面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:91
#: 2b2eb8f01a184e82ac02b9dbd344c061 a72b26c361d147d7a35d81b9742cb72f
#: c2e47075d63e47d09c4565e4a8c35549 d2b343f9b66b473491ca44bc32dea435
#: e408a0a2b0a847d1a464997aa357b5b2
msgid "\"Type\" should be set to \"Servo\""
msgstr "「Type」（类型）应设置为 「Servo」（舵机）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:92
#: 274deb2ec2c24bda8dd0821b6524e937 395d323620d045af969fc81c378a7823
#: d367585b258c4fc590ea5cf66882bddf d3977dd6cfae431dbb594c66d245deaa
#: eb94bea64c784f5fb6634dbddf053711
msgid ""
"\"Pitch\" should be set to \"SERVO9\" to specify AUX OUT 1 is connected to "
"the gimbal's pitch input"
msgstr "「Pitch」（俯仰）应设置为 「SERVO9」，以指定 AUX OUT 1 连接到云台俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:93
#: 476277f5375044789f58511ec7156511 4ce1d48f545548149e4b335dcf310297
#: 6d5e1b454f764a2bbb3fd4de70f3d0cd 7ecfee5c2b844d76b3ada9046e2b0929
#: c388c746154f43669c9065e57bd8af0b
msgid "\"Stabilize Pitch\" should be unchecked"
msgstr "「Stabilize Pitch」（稳定俯仰）应取消勾选"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:94
#: 15300fb9b5ce482f829a5fda1b72a60a 2b2962a3ea504f8b9fb5b6eeb869d73c
#: 2c730890ce6a4d7a9e71127c2e89f6ab 8721f15195f94d6dafc0a9fe71e79ef3
#: af80894327f84554a552fecb891f713d
msgid ""
"\"Servo Limits\" holds the minimum and maximum PWM values that will be sent "
"to the gimbal"
msgstr "「Servo Limits」（舵机限制）保存将发送到云台的最小和最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:95
#: 1050929c268348e7b08908a1db5a6e48 1d9580d8a5684334bb5b25c43429830d
#: 88646ef7e7324292996eda406edb0a8e b1e16cd7fdf548cbbe6d170a69c0d698
#: c721227fbc7a4402b6ccbbea310900cc
msgid ""
"\"Angle Limits\" are the earth-frame angles (in degrees) that the gimbal can"
" achieve. \"0\" degrees is straight ahead, \"-90\" is straight down"
msgstr "「Angle Limits」（角度限制）是云台可达到的地球坐标系角度（度）。「0」度为正前方，「-90」为正下方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:97
#: 1185373d0bd04f1b9eae882b9c5291d3 1a4c9eefeb5140a4bec46a99019455eb
#: 85402716f39740b2976975af1728c794 d72a1408dcbf476da3dfb70c2469e588
#: f6e6fbe9fa304beeaf99230c6751516d
msgid "If manually setting parameters for the first mount:"
msgstr "若手动设置第一个挂载点参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:99
#: 34c086351e0e4583ae0cf6fe20a8dc8c aa2e0da67d964171a60cf03272c3a5d2
#: aaff0d5338c841b3933955199c1ec9c2 acfe083052084d20a2cfeaa134a9d227
#: d87381e5417b4e63adf2452103c653d6
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 1 (for \"Servo\" gimbal)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 1（「Servo」云台）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:100
#: 0bb74cef6c9043589f324abd8c517009 4e6f0b94369c40bbb2dadb920d56cd6f
#: 5e9e60b8f3774d4a9a086bcf7a3ef3fe 6cd5dee7d3aa48a998a27509bd3ec7dd
#: cc65825e09ca4ce49f3fde030b7c5bf6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 to specify that RC input channel 6 "
"(normally the tuning knob) will be used to control the pitch of the gimbal"
msgstr ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213，指定 RC 输入第6通道（通常为调参旋钮）用于控制云台俯仰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:101
#: 373a28a9d54840c6a4e92d4d9bb75615 52259677796c4d8d83aa0c6012bf31ab
#: 83cbc2a8f33b4bff971e2df970b7a180 8fe4fe41bf414445a3dbea6c0323f1b0
#: beb08a8980954a92b9ef427a2db86af0
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` = 0 to specify the gimbal's highest "
"angle is zero degrees (i.e. forward)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` = 0，指定云台最高角度为零度（即正前方）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:102
#: 17e47702dfac4b04bb774be856307150 3247f5a3b172413e95aad1da4c74b298
#: 60a7ba87ed6d46d2bb24d8e01b5263c7 896cac4f1f6047808c9bada4d683c14b
#: f79f614a72e546198a4479fd0f6738af
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` = -90 to specify the gimbal's lowest "
"angle is 90 degrees (i.e. down)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` = -90，指定云台最低角度为90度（即正下方）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:103
#: 1381c72b94024a9c8c1faae60b207625 29d093f65a264002b2adb715ff327f11
#: 4377b1c576d14127ab0bc2c0e85d53db 5e13d50b392e4ed3bcebc50156b6e62a
#: f72b911009b94660b883a5397ab64909
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>` = 1000 to specify the minimum PWM value to "
"send to the gimbal"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>` = 1000，指定发送到云台的最小 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:104
#: 0ba673b6073347e39bfd5495a62e34a4 269ffe789dc0454a85ea6bbb5c788fa7
#: 492a5bef19954465818eff6057128655 5995d29ec49247bea3aacb57a41a708f
#: e27f5f8ea8eb49d896b3df427faf1bac
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>` = 1520 to specify the maximum PWM value to "
"send to the gimbal"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>` = 1520，指定发送到云台的最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:109
#: 1637bbb89a4b40128d9aefbdaf6a78dc 9476d05bb3ee4662a12eb9ccbee4970b
#: 9f742b81022d49b58f463954a59da6dd b3f1577d9c044891974714293a8c6dde
#: e06f10462abf45b3a86b51377306dd1a
msgid "Testing the gimbal moves correctly"
msgstr "测试云台移动是否正确"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:111
#: 1e3ee1df85c5494ea3b010412f293c14 9e5014e7f6334fae976d008d3e41a0dd
#: e1c06335e2444997b8d718d5b8d44ebd e629a3825c5f4d3fb96bd2b42aab940c
#: ee7d789d21f04df7bf24af980326f5b4
msgid "**Testing the pilot's control of pitch**"
msgstr "**测试飞手对俯仰的控制**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:113
#: 40a1994c5c074645972819703c07d5ee 88d0c53fabc94a579125bd4b596b0157
#: acba17cdf99f42e3b92b777bd3847a4b b18a12b006ee41b889d6ccb4b0474a0d
#: d397c89c3f954696b8a1bd967985fbac
msgid ""
"Once powered the gimbal should point to its Pitch Angle Min (i.e. straight "
"down) when your transmitter's channel 6 tuning knob is at its minimum pwm "
"value (perhaps around 1000) and the camera should point to its maximum pitch"
" angle (i.e. straight forward) when the tuning knob is at its maximum "
"(perhaps around 2000). The mission planner's Radio calibration page can be "
"used to check the Ch6's current input pwm value."
msgstr ""
"上电后，当遥控器第6通道调参旋钮处于最小 PWM "
"值（约1000）时，云台应指向其最小俯仰角（即正下方）；旋钮处于最大值（约2000）时，相机应指向最大俯仰角（即正前方）。可使用 Mission "
"Planner 的遥控校准页面检查第6通道当前输入的 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:115
#: 0303075c65054c2d8d15b8a2d5ee53a1 1e9a871f5f894e2ba6fae8a6a6780091
#: 6e919fbe65c24df5b5161d5c4d4447d2 8e4b8cd9d0b04d0088c2fea3883e9cd3
#: f282bd7d905543409737e1c3318d5d04
msgid "**Testing ROI**"
msgstr "**测试 ROI**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:117
#: 17356c6d5a624e9ab47bf70e6666700c 3ff44e17f9324705b2ac79e8dd645603
#: 5d1f511754ef4afcb4b1a558832b0a21 e229143ac10341ed82f4d1cde5708b86
#: fdc7fbdff4244e68b0ce69354c6190e9
msgid ""
"**You must have GPS lock to test ROI.** The ROI feature points the vehicle "
"and/or camera to point at a target. The instructions above describe a setup "
"so that only controls the pitch of the Tarot gimbal so when a :ref:`Do-Set-"
"ROI <copter:mission-command-list_do-set-roi>` command is received Copter "
"will attempt to turn the vehicle's nose to point in the direction of the "
"target and pitch the camera depending upon the vehicle's distance and "
"altitude. You can test the gimbal pitch moves correctly by connecting with "
"the mission planner, then on the Flight Data screen's map, right-mouse-"
"button-click on a point about 50m ahead of the vehicle (the orange and red "
"lines show the vehicle's current heading), select \"Point Camera Here\" and "
"input an altitude of -50 (meters). This should cause the gimbal to point "
"down at about 45 degrees."
msgstr ""
"**测试 ROI 必须有 GPS 锁定。** ROI 功能使飞行器和/或相机指向目标。上述设置仅控制 Tarot 云台的俯仰，因此当收到 "
":ref:`Do-Set-ROI <copter:mission-command-list_do-set-roi>` 命令时，Copter "
"将尝试将机头转向目标方向，并根据飞行器与目标的距离和高度调整相机俯仰角。可通过以下方式测试云台俯仰移动是否正确：连接 Mission "
"Planner，在飞行数据界面的地图上，在飞行器正前方约50m处右键点击一个点（橙色和红色线条显示飞行器当前航向），选择 「Point Camera "
"Here」，输入高度 -50（米）。这应使云台向下倾斜约45度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:122
#: 1ed48fa91e17420c863d3ed482632f02 7e5beca060c44aa69e6cbd5b5331fdab
#: a9a134b8461d42f19e9933e85c3e7c66 bdb9403a35b249679e4a0697f436c302
#: e6515f755bb24cc2a2874f3f9a3ec2f8
msgid ""
"Pilot control of the gimbal can be restored by setting up an :ref:`auxiliary"
" function switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` either “Retract Mount1” (i.e."
" RCx_OPTION = 27) or \"Retract Mount2\" (i.e. RCx_OPTION = 113), and then "
"move the switch to the lower position."
msgstr ""
"可通过设置 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 为 「Retract Mount1」（即 "
"RCx_OPTION = 27）或 「Retract Mount2」（即 RCx_OPTION = 113），将开关拨到低位来恢复飞手对云台的控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:125
#: 25fd9b11baee4ad0bfa2dacca9464bd1 2ceb011075da40d58115b5de1ef01a49
#: 2f81bdabf13d41f8a35666931f923236 b81cb59b6b7c4741bfffa209a9ce32d4
#: f65ccd3479ae47d1bf1648d687ac3697
msgid "Updating the gimbal software"
msgstr "更新云台软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:127
#: 10fa66707a774f56b91fd32b72cfefe2 35b2a84fcf404b0eb00c6a148c9cf3e9
#: 6e010c78a64b4a96ba9392ca3c39c424 92f571cb655d4fecaf55cdcc4e9262a3
#: ab29a423a50e43cea4273af301c5377e
msgid ""
"The gimbal must be running firmware version 1.4 or higher. Follow the "
"instructions below to update both the controller and motor firmwares."
msgstr "云台必须运行固件版本 1.4 或更高版本。请按以下说明同时更新控制器和电机固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:129
#: 00b091441ab948a8857c0b39d36807e7 a08b62fe8f8545a797ee85aeb364e833
#: aac8712dc12c4f3697b1e78c1561ca41 b222126b469045379e54be2eb9667101
#: b84c215d73d64599841c24cf7649b5d8
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal to your computer using the USB dongle. Ensure that the "
"gimbal end is plugged into the \"Gimbal Controller Connector\" (see diagram "
"in the Connecting the Gimbal to the Pixhawk section above). Leave the gimbal"
" unpowered for now."
msgstr ""
"使用 USB 适配器将云台连接到电脑。确保适配器连接到 「Gimbal Controller Connector」（云台控制器接口，见上方连接 "
"Pixhawk 部分的图示）。暂时不要为云台供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:130
#: 389a6ecc159042bbad6543251155f265 44e4035ccbd4410f9375d03e9cd3232a
#: 57cbc109fd9942d790d1d940e3e5abd6 81bb1ca8a5684340bc8910804b19bffe
#: def96b87a8e64220b259f0126a274205
msgid "Start the \"ZYX-BMGC-EN_V1.5\" configuration application"
msgstr "启动 「ZYX-BMGC-EN_V1.5」 配置应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:131
#: 09a6d342354743feb279b7396a443050 18991f83951c45c5847e79f0d7903761
#: 49ed2d571ff94b559696c45cab439fb4 a5b6bb04f5c84526889029bec132a543
#: da636d75905248f58c4c0e3cecea799e
msgid ""
"Select **Open Firmware** and select the **../Firmware_V1.5/Gimbal Controller"
" Firmware V1.5.bgsf** file from the `Tarot Gimbal Firmware v1.5 zip. "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__"
msgstr ""
"选择 **Open Firmware**，从 `Tarot 云台固件 v1.5 压缩包 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/ZYX-BMGC-"
"EN_V1.5.zip>`__ 中选择 **../Firmware_V1.5/Gimbal Controller Firmware "
"V1.5.bgsf** 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:132
#: 0e333883dc0a4ce1be906e7716791946 1646948328c846da8fbf87251ab1e6e9
#: 6abc17a210384ad8a038c55ec61cc7f9 8913893f68aa40658cea2792706ea34f
#: e743bdf66d42406abb52bea5b12c121f
msgid ""
"Select the COM Port that has been assigned to the gimbal, then select \"Open"
" COM Port.\""
msgstr "选择已分配给云台的 COM 端口，然后选择 「Open COM Port」（打开 COM 端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:133
#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:140
#: 16ffd891cc994216b0539f8a50ddc02c 2b5b72c9224c40b98f11d7faea344ddd
#: 411768bc7f0d4738b3e43265a211684a 56436e0778ec4868b166ec5d6fd30b22
#: 58dba37800a144c6b6cd6047de6038e6 936bb170da22452a9d229463fc100330
#: 9faa5314eae84a4a80f50efd9459d18c b8fb3748cab34bd083ddb944fc646638
#: cd19f65a71954b8b81fe466aa01c2ca1 e02a4de0f5094e88ba46f911c4e3edc9
msgid "Select **Start Upgrade**."
msgstr "选择 **Start Upgrade** （开始升级）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:134
#: 168e2b06825d4b979b13dee6cedbc51c 16f71e660cc047dea07864bcac82b378
#: 18ff6958ab2f452f8b9351d56bb27f99 68574d1544fb46e99b8f59377575c567
#: e9d9cc53ead54a35b87e1235da3d4fe3
msgid ""
"Connect the battery to power the gimbal. You will see a green progress bar "
"on the screen indicating the status of the update."
msgstr "连接电池为云台供电。屏幕上会出现绿色进度条显示更新状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:135
#: 45e1dd550f3f45809b5033b0b5d0295c 823814fa9905413cb743af3d06d277dc
#: 84b4425d659942a5bef77bdf4cdd2128 8dbce03852d5481897fed7941212bdca
#: 9f47309b7a7b4a2283fd862fffd919ea
msgid ""
"To verify that the firmware has updated successfully, disconnect and "
"reconnect the battery. Select **Open COM Port**, and check that the version "
"firmware number now displays the updated version."
msgstr "断开并重新连接电池以验证固件是否成功更新。选择 **Open COM Port**，检查固件版本号是否显示已更新的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:136
#: 3955a71605e641098d3093f98cf3b9fb 3cf06be0348647b999bc6cd039e9c88b
#: 9e3eab1f445d4426be82e7dcc65b3f96 d825c7049e064e23a2657faa382a4bcf
#: e6d4e74e91fe422593612853ffa51f4d
msgid ""
"Now you'll need to update the motor firmware. Disconnect the battery from "
"the gimbal so that it is not powered. Disconnect the USB dongle from the "
"\"Gimbal Controller Connector\" and reconnect to the \"Motor Driver "
"Connector\" on the other side of the board."
msgstr ""
"现在需要更新电机固件。断开电池切断云台电源。将 USB 适配器从 「Gimbal Controller Connector」 "
"拔下，重新连接到板子另一侧的 「Motor Driver Connector」（电机驱动接口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:137
#: 1ccd0efea8584a0cb8980b1e3d32788c 47b575c94574499096392b5858c127b2
#: 48fa0473757e4854bb469dbb10c52167 d26253ba007c423c83e72bfb67861f2d
#: ed43dd8308de45959e0361c3c8105a8a
msgid "Select **Motor Configuration**."
msgstr "选择 **Motor Configuration** （电机配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:138
#: 393cc24552bd4e27875b08ea7f472a0f 7bc6fe1479b546f5b4b8ad3879ebf592
#: 8b72ff3f233e40caad7f1f971782b7f6 c3f658d2c48944549f2c89a9d6519a77
#: df84746f6bfa40fa9d073253a3d58060
msgid ""
"Select **Open COM Port**. Ensure that the same COM port as before is "
"selected (the gimbal controller and motor controller use the same COM port)"
msgstr "选择 **Open COM Port**。确保选择与之前相同的 COM 端口（云台控制器和电机控制器使用同一 COM 端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:139
#: 22c95d6b250d451da28b014066fd23e7 8b69057b64664964a08471cb50fb4948
#: af04250b21544b20bfdbea2dc7b3c555 bed91b1753ba4fd6807f07e908ae37a6
#: cf5672cbb0484163b973f8ac0202e692
msgid ""
"Now select **Open Firmware**, but this time select the "
"**../Firmware_V1.5/Motor Driver Firmware V1.5.bmcf** file."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Open Firmware**，但这次选择 **../Firmware_V1.5/Motor Driver Firmware "
"V1.5.bmcf** 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:141
#: 1286903ddd624bcd85e4528f08d052c8 411b0c0f045345eb9618db43580e91a2
#: 901e8f991f7541adb902ecdeef422517 937f8ae6ebcf48488771b10b84c1b134
#: b641abe1955047d8aba52fe7284cd5fe
msgid ""
"Connect the battery to power the gimbal. There will be another progress bar "
"indicating the status of the upgrade."
msgstr "连接电池为云台供电。会出现另一个进度条显示升级状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:142
#: 0365f6e68d30406a8d2c66110c9b1284 05b3d7e76f154dc397b9b986c6f46576
#: 4884c2d5d2ea4f2aba81e95a9d29e3a2 baf923541618421b8342f2dff1d718dd
#: f5aba6f0d5524e95b52e4f3813122336
msgid ""
"Disconnect and reconnect the battery from the gimbal to complete the upgrade"
" process."
msgstr "断开并重新连接电池以完成升级过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tarot-gimbal.rst:143
#: 3490e2271b844160831ac7aefd6e2613 63d1a16d0bae4c87b790d08f1ea15803
#: 72d1913958a948c1b1d32885737d0b94 7af7ed8929ed40cba32d84a4bdacddd3
#: fbdc4e2b63e840d998769547d1006bcf
msgid ""
"You may need to check/set the configuration settings again, as above. In "
"particular, check that the manual control mode is \"Stick Position Mode\" "
"and remember to write your settings when you're done!"
msgstr ""
"可能需要再次检查/设置配置设置（如上所述）。特别是检查手动控制模式是否为 「Stick Position "
"Mode」（摇杆位置模式），完成后记得写入设置！"
